# Diagram — class/type relation view for LoopController implementers
#
# Mermaid has no separate first-class UML contract in codrax today, so
# this case exercises the generic diagram contract for a class/type
# relationship view: interface node plus implementer nodes. It catches
# diagram grounding and member-boundary drift for "class diagram" style
# requests without adding language-specific syntax assumptions.
ID="qf_type_relation_loop_controller"
NAME="diagram — type relation LoopController implementers"
QUESTION="请用 Mermaid 类图或类型关系图表示 LoopController 接口和它的主要实现类型之间的关系，并列出每个实现类型所在文件。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="LoopController analyzerEvaluator explorerEvaluator extractorEvaluator"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX='(```mermaid|classDiagram|flowchart|graph[[:space:]]+(TD|LR))
(answerDocumentEvaluator|finalizer.*Evaluator|plannerEvaluator|verifierEvaluator|writeAnalyzerEvaluator)'
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS=".java BaseAgent.java"
